: \nL50: The first known use of malapportionment was in 1943\nL51: \nL52: 【20†See more words from the same year】\nL53: ### The Ultimate Dictionary Awaits\nL54: \nL55: Expand your vocabulary and dive deeper into language with Merriam-Webster Unabridged.\nL56: \nL57:   1. Expanded definitions\nL58:   2. Detailed etymologies\nL59:   3. Advanced search tools\nL60:   4. All ad-free\nL61: \nL62: Discover what makes Merriam-Webster Unabridged the essential choice for true word lovers.\nL63: \nL64: 【21†Start Your Free Trial Now†unabridged.merriam-webster.com】\nL65: \nL66: ## Browse Nearby Words\nL67: \nL68: 【17†malapportioned】\nL69: \nL70: malapportionment\nL71: \nL72: 【22†mala praxis】\nL73: \nL74: 【23†See all Nearby Words】\nL75: ## Cite this Entry\nL76: \nL77: Style\nL78: \nL79: [Select]\nL80: \nL81: “Malapportionment.” Merriam-Webster.com Dictionary, Merriam-Webster, https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/malapportionment. Accessed 24 Oct. 2026.\nL82: \nL83: 【24†Image†prod.cdn-mw.com】Copy Citation\nL84: \nL85: Love words? Need even more definitions?\nL86: \nL87: Subscribe to America's largest dictionary and get thousands more definitions and advanced search—ad free!\nL88: \nL89: ## More from Merriam-Webster\nL90: \nL91: #### 【3†Word of the Day】\nL92: \nL93: #### 【3†puissant】\nL94: \nL95: 【3†See Definitions and Examples】 »\nL96: ## Popular in Grammar & Usage\nL97: \nL98: 【4†See More】\nL99: \nL100: 【25†Merriam-Webster’s Great Big List of Words You Love to Hate】\nL101: \nL102: 【26†'Can' vs. 'May'】\nL103: \nL104: 【27†'Affect' vs. 'Effect'】\nL105: \nL106: 【28†More Commonly Mispronounced Words】\nL107: \nL108: 【29†Is it 'nerve-racking' or 'nerve-wracking'?】\nL109: ## Popular in Wordplay\nL110: \nL111: 【8†See More】\nL112: \nL113: 【30†The Longest Long Words List】\nL114: \nL115: 【31†9 Words That Sound Like Insults But Aren't】\nL116: \nL117: 【32†The Words of the Week - Oct. 23】\nL118: \nL119: 【33†Even More Bird Names that Sound Like Insults (and Sometimes Are)】\nL120: \nL121: 【3